  "findings": [
    "maintenance_transport._session is a shared gate point for capture/preflight/apply/verify/exporter; transaction engine need not change.",
    "_validate_credentials currently accepts a port key but does not assert 5432; explicit port gate is required.",
    "_tool currently accepts caller argument arrays and reports only bytes; exact finite argument validation and per-invocation proof are required.",
    "checks.capture_baseline currently uses backend SSL boolean as client gate; the query remains, its authority changes only under explicit risk contract.",
    "backup_adapter manifest and exact file inventory must be extended forward to bind each output to its own tool proof.",
    "plan_contract carries v3 literal and strict fields; versioned risk binding and v4 reference belong there.",
    "receipts supports generic typed safe records already; runner CLI and transaction interfaces need no changes."
  ],
